## 7. CLOSING NOTE ON IDENTITY

None of these systems copy Vampire Survivors' bullet-heaven stacking, nor Brotato's item-shop power spiral. Dirty Road's identity is built on:
- **A living health meter (Vitality) instead of a kill-count power fantasy.**
- **Taxonomy-driven enemy design mapped 1:1 to real pollution categories.**
- **Difficulty tied to player *behavior* (Pollution Index), not just a clock.**
- **Zero-friction, fact-based micro-learning instead of any tutorial text walls.**
- **A permanent, honest thesis: pollution never truly ends — only your care matters.**

This is the differentiator: it's not "another wave survivor," it's a **living ecosystem simulation disguised as fast action combat.**
